{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/extras/\ub215\uae30_\uc601\uc5b4.gif?t=1742984278\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;The child has disappeared.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, a mother who lost her child desperately follows the traces left behind. During her search, she hears a rumor about a malevolent spirit that preys only on children and resides in the ruins deep within the forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clinging to the faintest hope, she tirelessly tracks down the place and finally arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just then, a familiar voice echoes from somewhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chasing the sound through the darkness, she soon finds herself trapped in an endless corridor with no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is only one way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230420/extras/\ubd80\uc801_\uc601\uc5b4.gif?t=1742984278\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe your surroundings carefully and explore thoroughly to uncover any anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you find no clues, move on to the next stage. But if you notice something strange, head for the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will try to deceive you by any means. Never let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Input</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movements : W, A, S, D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk : Left Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flashlight : F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact : LMB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uninteract : RMB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotation Reset : WMB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2230420